WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,140
Master Guo

2
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:07,780
Can you please allow me to ask this old man a few questions?

3
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:08,980
I'm asking you

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:13,860
What are you doing for a living now?

5
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,740
Small farm at home

6
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,700
When it’s salty, I’ll go to the river to catch some fish and shrimp to sell.

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,420
Then your annual income is already combined

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,380
On good days, it lasts for one year

9
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,620
Almost two taels of silver

10
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:31,700
How many years will you save fifty taels of silver? When Master Gospel comes back

11
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:34,300
I arranged for Yayi to search at Mr. Zhao’s home.

12
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:43,110
I found a certain amount of fifty taels of silver and brought it up to my fourth uncle. What does this mean?

13
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,530
Bold Zhao Laosi

14
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:47,210
Who asked you to give this perjury?

15
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:48,530
It's better to recruit them honestly

16
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:49,690
Listen to the great master

17
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,370
I can't help it

18
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:55,570
If I don't charge them, they will kill my little one.

19
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:57,290
The little one really only saw

20
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:58,770
The little one didn't lie

21
00:00:58,970 --> 00:01:00,810
But that person is not Fang Yang

22
00:01:01,010 --> 00:01:04,220
He's from the Lianshui Gang, the Cao Gang
